{
  "name": "Mirage",
  "label": "MIRAGE / 15",
  "description": "The desert finale. Hop the dune for the first apple, then clear the gaps: the apples float in the air above them, so jump high as well as far. The kicker throws you onto a floating island: land on its back slope, collect the apple, and ride off its far edge across a 100 unit gap. The sand pit at the end has a floor, but coming up short costs time.",
  "lesson": "Apples floating over gaps, and a floating island to jump onto and off.",
  "alsoNew": "Heat haze.",
